# Pickleball Sub-Module Navigation

When adding a sub-module menu under the main Pickleball hub nav, style it as a derivative/secondary navigation, not as another primary tab row.

- Keep the primary hub nav visually dominant.
- Give sub-module navs a distinct secondary treatment: smaller/inset spacing, softer background or tint, subtler buttons, and a clear module label when useful.
- Use a specific class or accessible selector such as `aria-label="League play"` so the sub-menu style does not unintentionally affect the primary hub nav.
- Apply the pattern consistently across mirrored Pickleball trees (`advanced-open-play/staging`, `live`, and shared `league-play` copies when present).
